abstract: "Code, prompts and data for the article \"AI-assisted lemmatization of Estonian dialectal runosongs: Language models and linguistic resources for cultural heritage texts\" by Kaarel Veskis and Taive Särg. The article evaluates large language models for lemmatizing Estonian dialectal runosongs, with and without linguistic resources, and compares them with rule-based and neural tools. The repository holds the lemmatization pipeline and its prompts, the per-word predictions of every system and run scored in the article's Tables 1 and 2 (3,216 words from forty-five songs), and a script that recomputes the agreement figures."
